// Runs each in-service cron tick. A live location is "down" when its last successful pull is older than
// POS_ALERT_MIN (default 15) or its most recent pull errored. State is tracked in KV (posalert:<id>) so we
// email exactly once when it goes down and once when it recovers — never a mail storm while it stays down.
